{
  "_comment": "Calibration fixture for the gate case runner and the severity-specific test files: the canonical severities the shipped cases were authored against (AG warn tier — teaching notes; AG2 error; WB error). The tracked config.json next to loader.ts is user policy and may ship rules off; cases must not follow that churn. PGATE_CONFIG points here before the gate import.",
